{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 6, :comments ["<b>On that day</b> — then shall be fulfilled the sword upon his arm and upon his right eye, and he is blind, also his horse; therefore they shall eat them like a fiery hearth — like a pan of fire." "<b>shall dwell</b> — the sense: its inhabitants shall dwell."], :book :zechariah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 12, :notes {0 "Ibn Ezra's phrase 'חרב על זרועו ועל עין ימינו' alludes to Zechariah 11:17; 'ככיור' glossed as 'ככירת' (like a pan/hearth)."}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Zecharia -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/zecharya"] ["1" "http://www.daat.ac.il/daat/olam_hatanah/mefaresh.asp?book=25&perek=5&mefaresh=ezra"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:46:53.671682383Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}